WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.537
Module 2 is help desk
authority in Entra ID.

2
00:00:03.537 --> 00:00:04.789
In Active Directory,

3
00:00:04.789 --> 00:00:08.763
the directory tree answered whose
password the desk could reset.

4
00:00:08.763 --> 00:00:13.794
Entra answers it in three parts: the role
decides what a technician can do, the

5
00:00:13.794 --> 00:00:16.111
target decides whether it applies,

6
00:00:16.111 --> 00:00:19.625
and administrative units
(AUs) narrow the population.

7
00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:24.140
Get any one wrong, and the desk either
can't work or can do far too much.
